{"meta":{"id":"tt33539520","type":"series","name":"Neagley","imdb_id":"tt33539520","description":"Del universo de REACHER, comienza un nuevo capítulo. Frances Neagley es una investigadora privada en Chicago y excompañera militar de Jack Reacher en la Unidad 110 de Investigaciones Especiales del Ejército. Al enterarse de que un querido amigo de su pasado murió en un accidente sospechoso, no se detendrá hasta hacer justicia.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt33539520.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uYOYLFQ4q7asuhdiKXCqGaeAQUH.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lI6zO2lw8pteZnIzm1DuucVGutG.png","genres":["Drama","Misterio","Crimen"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"7.6","country":"United States of America","cast":["Maria Sten","Greyston Holt","Adeline Rudolph","Matthew Del Negro","Damon Herriman","Jasper Jones"],"writer":["Nick Santora","Nicholas Wootton","Thomas Delfino","Lee Child"],"trailers":[{"source":"BOzNaa_o9_g","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"BOzNaa_o9_g","lang":"en"},{"source":"e4R4guZS0WU","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Teaser Trailer","ytId":"e4R4guZS0WU","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"BOzNaa_o9_g","title":"Official Trailer"},{"ytId":"e4R4guZS0WU","title":"Official Teaser Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"7.6","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt33539520"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Misterio","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Misterio"},{"name":"Crimen","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Crimen"},{"name":"Maria Sten","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Maria%20Sten"},{"name":"Greyston Holt","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Greyston%20Holt"},{"name":"Adeline Rudolph","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Adeline%20Rudolph"},{"name":"Matthew Del Negro","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Matthew%20Del%20Negro"},{"name":"Damon Herriman","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Damon%20Herriman"},{"name":"Jasper Jones","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jasper%20Jones"},{"name":"Nick Santora","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Nick%20Santora"},{"name":"Nicholas Wootton","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Nicholas%20Wootton"},{"name":"Thomas Delfino","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Thomas%20Delfino"},{"name":"Lee Child","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Lee%20Child"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Maria Sten","character":"Frances Neagley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/7QlPWbZRH2ORMmAHKAj0rq54t4A.jpg","tmdbId":2123496},{"name":"Greyston Holt","character":"Detective Hudson Riley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/OefIUfHekZLHwGVjyZmFauUI5W.jpg","tmdbId":206405},{"name":"Adeline Rudolph","character":"Renee","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/rkcZTtTTqTe8QK4UMIjHHVefdnN.jpg","tmdbId":2168270},{"name":"Matthew Del Negro","character":"Pierce Woodrow","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/h3wcgMRunRmeFhFo16BJpKsqQQC.jpg","tmdbId":85484},{"name":"Damon Herriman","character":"Lawrence Cole","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/hzh9i0BlAEQDAhJxEgkEcBxMlJv.jpg","tmdbId":62752},{"name":"Jasper Jones","character":"Keno","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/9Zbyjx753eion9IqYMbCVfDdFs0.jpg","tmdbId":3598266}],"writers":[{"name":"Nick Santora","character":"Nick Santora","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/iipP9fTQhRuPJHFMhbpMCceBiiu.jpg","tmdbId":78417},{"name":"Nicholas Wootton","character":"Nicholas Wootton","photo":null,"tmdbId":1214469},{"name":"Thomas Delfino","character":"Thomas Delfino","photo":null,"tmdbId":6406673},{"name":"Lee Child","character":"Lee Child","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/bJiJb69N2h4MdvdP2PjUpgJdCll.jpg","tmdbId":1056052}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqprC6jdAEQWf9mTVeAKBNes6VM.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt33539520:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Vías del tren","overview":"Cuando Tommy, el amigo de la infancia de Neagley, muere tras caminar hacia un tren en movimiento, la policía lo clasifica como un accidente, pero Neagley se da cuenta de que algo está mal al recibir un misterioso mensaje de su amigo muerto.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xkr1SLWz53eVPO8FOF9aD8qbvih.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt33539520:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Dinámicas de grupo","overview":"La investigación de Neagley sobre la sospechosa muerte de Tommy Crane, su amigo de la infancia, se enfrenta con un sinfín de obstáculos, y un secreto oculto durante años podría cambiar todo lo que creía saber sobre su niñez.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5cZzudEmBxSypcp3pePoKdoh3TW.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt33539520:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Hora de actuar","overview":"Una emboscada le proporciona a Neagley su mejor pista hasta ahora, pero la policía local intenta dejarla fuera del caso.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iJL6mZlA9gsXFxsLvhoa1lhMANb.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"53 min"},{"id":"tt33539520:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Allanamiento","overview":"Neagley llama la atención de unos enemigos peligrosos con su investigación sobre la muerte de Tommy, y ahora ella y su equipo están en riesgo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kNijBiFiDXMN2OMAQFL8FtqM12O.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"52 min"},{"id":"tt33539520:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Viaje","overview":"Las verdades ocultas sobre el pasado de Neagley salen a la luz y la obligan a confiar más que nunca en su nuevo equipo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bp023I82NtpeObr4Of7yXraRJI2.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt33539520:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Golpe duro","overview":"Neagley tiene pruebas nuevas y descubre que no solo es responsable de resolver la muerte de Tommy, sino muchísimas más.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/te7toAuRc6AnFQb72fFYtDJ0PVn.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt33539520:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"LeBron no es Jordan","overview":"Las pistas se agotan, y Hudson debe hacer un pacto con el diablo para mantener el caso abierto.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oFpVyEULRD6rAXLwoEU8jhMYxxa.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt33539520:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Contacto","overview":"Con el legado de su amigo de la infancia en juego y las vidas de su equipo en riesgo, Neagley hace un último esfuerzo para llevar a los asesinos de Tommy ante la justicia.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g9oiwVozajHyUaCSABoDj7FSh6v.jpg","released":"2026-09-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"53 min"}]}}